                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/pulls/comments/4000013823"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "```suggestion\n    local line = util.get_line(buf, row)\n    col = col + vim.str_utf_start(line, col) - 1\n```\nNit: we can avoid getting a line twice when `col == 0`.",
